x3 T1 [[Rare Weapons|Rares]] ([https://supremevalues.com/mm2/ Supreme])}}'''Gingercookie''' is an {{C|Rare|rare}} knife that was obtainable from the 26th Battle Pass during the [[Christmas Event 2025]].

== Appearance ==
The blade is decorated with red and white candy‑cane striping and swirling engravings. The handle has a gingerbread‑like texture with carved swirl patterns and frosted accents, giving it a festive look.

== Trivia ==

* It has a [[Gingercookie (Gun)|matching gun]] under the same name.

